ection>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20130724152109&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Opticording_Sphere_0491cc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an opticording sphere.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This strange box holds a dark sphere. There is some kind of button at one side and a lens up front.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item can be easily obtained (even by a level 8). Be aware of scammers trying to sell it for a high price!<br/>When you use it, you get the following message: <i>\"Nothing happens except... no, absolutely nothing is happening at all.\"</i><br/>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Complete%20Opticording%20Sphere\">Complete Opticording Sphere</a>.\nObtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a>. Can be found in a crate after going down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32682,31604,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this hole (32682, 31604, 7)</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>. To open a passage you have to light both wall torches. The Opticording Sphere is in a crate at the southwest corner of the room.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Opticording%20Sphere\">Broken Opticording Sphere</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Complete%20Opticording%20Sphere\">Complete Opticording Sphere</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Opticorder%20Analyser%20%28Activated%29\">Opticorder Analyser (Activated)</a></li><li>Opticorder Forge</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["opticording-sphere-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Tirar a esfera da caixa","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"5-4","n":36,"title":"Completar a esfera","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":32682,"y":31604,"z":7,"text":"This item can be easily obtained (even by a level 8). Be aware of scammers trying to sell it for a high price! When you use it, you get the following message: \"Nothing happens except... no, absolutely nothing is happening at all.\" It looks the same as a…"}]}}